# Cached data — regenerated on each run, never commit
*.xlsx
.cache/

# brent_cache.csv IS committed: Investing.com returns HTTP 403 to GitHub
# Actions' IPs, so CI can never fetch Brent data live and always falls back
# to this file. Refresh it by running generate_oil_dashboard.py locally and
# committing the updated file. See README's "Brent data" section.

